    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5f70ec74-cb97-5831-ae70-6d7f1c586196" activityNameId="d0f273f5-6e60-5eef-8d11-af0fbe3ee403" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Noise barrier wall, construction, ribbed concrete panel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Noise barrier wall, construction, ribbed concrete panel
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 64fb08da-c105-4807-82df-95e9e10fb043
1 meter of noise barrier wall installed along the roadside in open terrain.
Total visible height: 3.2 meters, consisting of a ribbed concrete panel with a height of 3.0 meters. Service life 80 years.
The system boundary includes production (A1–A3) and construction / transport (A4–A5) stages for one meter of installed noise barrier wall, including excavation, backfilling, and foundation works.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Based on ASTRA 21001, Fachhandbuch Trassee/Umwelt (FHB T/U),  Lärmschutzwand Freifeld, Betonrippenplatte (ASTRA). Dimensions based on scaled measurement using known reference values.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_64fb08da-c105-4807-82df-95e9e10fb043.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
